WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.868
[music playing]

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:08.475
[sirens blaring]

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:11.111
DAVE: (VOICEOVER)
She keeps reaching

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.113
around in the center console.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:16.149
It looks like she's trying
to get something out,

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:17.150
maybe a handgun.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:23.356
MAN: All right, GSP has a
driver out of the vehicle.

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:30.363
DAVE: That's our girl.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.047
Was it loaded or no?

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.416
MAN: Oh, it was?

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:52.485
DAVE: There was a
loaded 38 caliber pistol

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.154
located in the center console.

00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:07.065
All right, so he's
running the dog on him

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.467
right now on the van.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.640
Oh, there it is.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.409
MAN ON RADIO: Yes, so the dog
alerted on that back side door

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:17.210
there.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:26.219
DAVE: Oh, I see a box on
the ground in the back.

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.654
Sort of looks like
they found it.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:34.461
I mean, there's 20 packages, so
just depending on how much they

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.095
weigh out, I think
we're probably

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:37.831
going to be close to 25 kilos.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.974
So we're taking a female
passenger and the driver

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:49.008
to jail.

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:50.410
You want him on this side?

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:52.545
DAVE: And they'll be
charged with trafficking,

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:56.783
and then the male will have
some firearms charges as well.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.184
Everybody did what they
were supposed to do.

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:01.621
You know, it went as
fluid as it could have,

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:05.091
and, you know, we took a large
quantity of methamphetamine

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:06.559
off the street.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:08.728
Right now, we're just
going down to the precinct.

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:10.596
I'll see if-- about
getting a test kit.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:14.133
We'll test the drugs, see
if it's methamphetamine.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.202
Very good for law
enforcement today, and not

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:18.571
so good for the bad guys.

